                                                "example_id": "5736e25d-22bf-4bee-9064-71b87f950431",
                                                "sense_id": "e10ee60e-3af9-348d-9bb7-505a2616f2c9",
                                                "text": "Indeed, the infantry battle on the desolate ridgeline above Darwin would probably have seemed remarkably familiar to a World War I stormtrooper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63f2b6c3-c8e0-41ae-b8c6-594b847747d8",
                                                "sense_id": "e10ee60e-3af9-348d-9bb7-505a2616f2c9",
                                                "text": "As you'll recall, the idea of the stormtrooper arose from the effort to break out of the trench warfare of World War I."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f20a891-8877-4a41-8e91-3b264ed365fb",
                                                "sense_id": "e10ee60e-3af9-348d-9bb7-505a2616f2c9",
                                                "text": "When he came upon such a scene he went up to a stormtrooper to protest."
